### Cambia el puerto para probar cada arquitectura:
###   8101 capas (Quarkus) · 8111 hexagonal (Quarkus) · 8112 hexagonal (Python)
@base = http://localhost:8111

### ¿Qué arquitectura y qué adaptador?
GET {{base}}/api/info

### Crear un borrador (sin imagen)
# @name draft
POST {{base}}/api/inventions
Content-Type: application/json

{"inventorId": "ana", "name": "Paraguas solar", "price": 49.90}

### Publicar sin imagen → 422 IMAGE_REQUIRED
POST {{base}}/api/inventions/{{draft.response.body.id}}/publish

### Agregar la imagen
PUT {{base}}/api/inventions/{{draft.response.body.id}}/image
Content-Type: application/json

{"imageUrl": "https://img.example/paraguas.png"}

### Publicar → 200 PUBLISHED
POST {{base}}/api/inventions/{{draft.response.body.id}}/publish

### Precio 0 → 422 PRICE_MUST_BE_POSITIVE
POST {{base}}/api/inventions
Content-Type: application/json

{"inventorId": "ana", "name": "Gratis", "price": 0}

### Nombre repetido (mayúsculas y espacios no importan) → 409 NAME_ALREADY_USED
POST {{base}}/api/inventions
Content-Type: application/json

{"inventorId": "ana", "name": "  PARAGUAS solar ", "price": 10}

### Inventos de un inventor
GET {{base}}/api/inventions?inventorId=ana
